            <p>Through <a href="https://www.democratising.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">democratising.ai</a>, I put AI transformation into practice in my own portfolio, building shared workflows, tools and publications with clear checks and human accountability. These include my <a href="/edge">EDGE framework</a> and <a href="https://aiinasia.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AIinASIA</a>, informed by the different markets, languages and working cultures in which technology needs to succeed.</p>

